Package: gsbundle
Type: Package
Title: Gene Set Retrieval and Gene ID Conversion Utilities
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Allan", "Lui", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "allan.lui@cruk.cam.ac.uk"),
    person("Wubing", "Zhang", role = "aut",
           comment = "Original author of adapted code from MAGeCKFlute"))
Description: Provides functions for gene ID conversion across multiple
    formats and organisms, and retrieval of gene set annotations from
    KEGG, Reactome, Gene Ontology, MSigDB, and CORUM databases.
    Annotation data is cached locally in the user cache directory.
